      "decision": "considered",
      "rationale": "Retrieved card and cached UniRank section2.3 describe separate ID capacity and target-aware pooling. Expanding IDs would confound this conditional-action question, so it is not adopted. Original Zenith paper remains unaudited and no external numerical claims transfer.",
